      <description align="center" color="red" colored="true" height="560" resized="true" width="370" x="12" y="17">Prepare Equipment status Constraints&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Siva Pedapalem&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;This process within the equipment block restricts equipment switching within the same category, such as VHP, BFW, or Air Compressors. However, switching between different categories, like motor to turbine and vice versa, is allowed. This behavior is enforced by introducing additional constraints, variables, and parameters into the optimization flow.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inputs:&lt;br&gt;1: actual data&lt;br&gt;2: equipment&lt;br&gt;availability&lt;br&gt;3: model_tag&lt;br&gt;4: equipment&lt;br&gt;category&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Output:&lt;br&gt;1:parameter add&lt;br&gt;2:variable add&lt;br&gt;3:constraint add&lt;br&gt;4:equipment initial&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <description align="center" color="blue" colored="true" height="559" resized="true" width="291" x="380" y="20">Main</description>
      <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="175" resized="false" width="180" x="438" y="306">O/P 1:parameter add&lt;br&gt;O/P 2:variable add&lt;br&gt;O/P 3:constraint add&lt;br&gt;O/P 4:equipment initial&lt;br&gt;</description>
    </process>
